      "title": "Events forwarder is not delivering events",
      "description": "CoPilot is queueing events but cannot deliver them to Core. This usually indicates that Core is offline, the token/host is wrong, or networking is blocked.\n\nCurrent queue depth: {queue_len}\nError streak: {error_streak}\nDropped total: {dropped_total}\n\nSuggested checks: verify Core is online, confirm host/port/token in the integration config, and check logs for connectivity errors."
    }
